<div class="container-fluid mt-4">
	<div class="row">

		<div class="col-md-12">
			<p>
				The DFW Geeks and Nerds was founded to help local nerds and geeks congregate to do nerd activites and explore Dallas.
				This group has events that are designed for 18+ and and some events for familes. We want you to come to these events and share with us the nerdy things that you are passionate about.
				You can expect the DFW geeks and nerds to organize and host events such as: 
				
				Anime Conventions
				Video Game Lan Parties
				Anime Nights
				Virtual Reality Game Nights
				Musuems of Dallas
				Movie Night
				Dinner Nights with Trivia
				Board Game Nights
				Arcade Nights
				Card Game Tournaments				
				Nature Walks and Camping
				Pokemon Go
				Escape Rooms
				Medevil times
				Laser Tag and Bowling
				Esports Events
			</p>
			<p>Please Note that we take event suggestions! There is an event signup and event suggestion form on this website!</p>
